menu "Controller USB diagnostics"
config CONTROLLER_USB_HS_AUDIO_DIAGNOSTIC
    bool "Diagnostic: defer HS audio until validated boot; quarantine after panic"
    default n
    depends on ESP_COREDUMP_ENABLE_TO_FLASH
    help
        Bench-only HS audio investigation. MIDI initializes normally; HS audio
        waits at least ten seconds and for OTA validation. After a panic, HS
        audio remains disabled for that boot so Wi-Fi can expose the crash dump.
        Does not bypass startup health or change the FS/FLX4 audio path.
endmenu
